Modifications include:

* Integration with ARC framework's META-PRD and PROJECT-STATUS system
* Enhanced task breakdown and progress tracking protocols
* Feature branch workflow integration
* Quality gate integration with DEVELOPMENT-RULES
* Session handoff and context preservation mechanisms
* Atomic commit workflow integration

All other components of the ARC framework represent original work built around and extending these core workflows.
